<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Analytic Transition (Graph-GRPO)</figcaption>
