ze="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">z</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{t}^{\theta}(z_{t},z_{t+\Delta t})\leftarrow p_{\theta}(z_{t+\Delta t})V_{1}+(1-p_{\theta}(z_{t})-p_{\theta}(z_{t+\Delta t}))V_{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="alg2.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l5.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"> Analytic Rate Matrix, Eq <a href="#S3.E10" title="Equation 10 ‣ Proposition 3.1. ‣ 3.1 Estimation of Rate Matrix ‣ 3 The Proposed Method ‣ Graph-GRPO: Training Graph Flow Models with Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a></span>
</span>
</div>
