<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Experimental results on the protein docking task on ZINC250k <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Irwin et al., 2012</a>)</cite>.
Baseline results are taken from GDPO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. We use the same benchmark evaluation protocol for a fair comparison. <span id="S4.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">The best results are highlighted in bold</span>.</span></figcaption>
